%% Importing a Markdown file. The failure path is the interesting one:
%% the user's text is handed back rather than swallowed.
flowchart TB
  File[".md file the user was sent"] --> Split{splitFrontMatter}
  Split -->|opened and never closed| Fail
  Split -->|no fence| Body[Body only, defaults applied]
  Split -->|fenced| Parse{parseFrontMatter}
  Parse -->|anchor, alias, tag, flow,<br/>too deep, too large, bad key| Fail
  Parse -->|subset| Map[Map to document fields]
  Body --> Map
  Map --> Schema{FoldmarkDocumentSchema}
  Schema -->|invalid| Fail
  Schema -->|valid| Review[Show findings, then store]
  Fail["Reject with the reason,<br/>the line number,<br/>and the original source"]
